    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Symbolic Cartography.</strong> You read the world as if it were a layered map of omens, routes, and stories waiting to happen.</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to Athletics (Violence) checks and a +2 bonus to passive Athletics (Violence).</li><li>When you study a route, hex, or region for a minute, the GM may give you additional information about likely hazards, safe paths, or narrative pressure points.</li><li>Bad Eden travel and hex systems may treat you as having an edge on route evaluation, hazard prediction, or choosing between available paths.</li></ul>",
